                                <h2 id="manutencao-registros-GETapi-maintenance-records">Listar todos os registros de manutenção.</h2>

<p>
<small class="badge badge-darkred">requires authentication</small>
</p>

<p>Retorna uma lista paginada dos registros para o condomínio autenticado.
Pode ser filtrado por <code>maintenance_schedule_id</code> ou <code>maintenance_equipment_id</code>.</p>

<span id="example-requests-GETapi-maintenance-records">
<blockquote>Example request:</blockquote>


<div class="bash-example">
    <pre><code class="language-bash">curl --request GET \
    --get "http://localhost/api/maintenance/records?page=1&amp;per_page=15&amp;maintenance_schedule_id=1&amp;maintenance_equipment_id=1&amp;status=%22pending%22" \
    --header "Content-Type: application/json" \
    --header "Accept: application/json"</code></pre></div>


<div class="javascript-example">
    <pre><code class="language-javascript">const url = new URL(
    "http://localhost/api/maintenance/records"
);

const params = {
    "page": "1",
    "per_page": "15",
    "maintenance_schedule_id": "1",
    "maintenance_equipment_id": "1",
    "status": ""pending"",
};
Object.keys(params)
    .forEach(key =&gt; url.searchParams.append(key, params[key]));

const headers = {
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "Accept": "application/json",
};

fetch(url, {
    method: "GET",
    headers,
}).then(response =&gt; response.json());</code></pre></div>

</span>

